- [Narrator] I've been
thinking a lot recently

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:14.550
about microcosms because
recently in my own life,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:18.180
understanding what a microcosm is

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.630
has really helped me live
a better life day to day,

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.240
and I really hope that if
you are in a rough place,

