00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:25.920
There is no difference
between going to the gym today

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:28.590
and going to the gym for
the rest of your life,

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:31.110
because going to the gym
for the rest of your life

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.120
